RO can adapt to changing wind conditions

Challenge is combining time varying source of power with process designed for steady state

469 - attention to detail? - "Maybe you want to be more explicit.)"

MVC (thermal) is better in remote places, RO is better with some grid connection.

Important to look at specific sites},
  doi        = {10.1016/j.desal.2006.05.009},
  file       = {:Lit/Feasibility.pdf:PDF},
  groups     = {Desal Systems, Other Renewable Desal},
  keywords   = {Seawater desalination, Mechanical vapor compression, Reverse osmosis, Membrane desalination, Wind energy, Renewable energy},
  publisher  = {Elsevier BV},
