  abstract  = {• A reverse osmosis (RO) desalination plant for the MOD river in Iraq is presented. • Variation of temperature, pressure and recovery in membrane module are considered. • Water for drinking and irrigation applications are discussed. • Salt rejection rates sensitivities to temperature and pressure are highlighted. • An economic analysis is carried out to determine the total water cost (TWC).},
